5. Latency Verification
Ensure rollback performance remains acceptable.

for i in {1..5}
do
  START=$(date +%s%3N)

  aws sagemaker-runtime invoke-endpoint \
      --endpoint-name my-endpoint \
      --content-type application/json \
      --body fileb://golden_request.json \
      /tmp/out.json >/dev/null

  END=$(date +%s%3N)

  echo "$((END-START))"
done


Acceptance:
Average latency <= pre-deployment baseline + 20%

Check
 Latency within SLA
 No excessive degradation

